{"message":"feat: wasm32-wasip1 support for oxibrowser-core + agentplug plugin integration\n\nFeature-gates oxibrowser-core's native-only deps (wreq/TLS, tokio-tungstenite,\noxibrowser-render/Blitz, OS threads) behind a native Cargo feature so the\ncrate compiles for wasm32-wasip1 with --no-default-features. Network calls\nproxy to a JS host via a host_fetch WASI import. The JS engine runs inline\non the caller's thread under wasm instead of spawning an OS thread.\n\nAdds a wasm_dispatch module exposing navigate/evaluate/dom-query/\nextract-markdown/capabilities verbs through the agentplug loadable-plugin\nABI, verified end-to-end against the live gm agentplug daemon and a\nstandalone wasmtime host harness.\n\nVendors the built wasm into thebird with refresh-oxibrowser.mjs and a\nbrowser-side loader with a real host_fetch via synchronous XMLHttpRequest.\n\nAdds a wasm32-wasip1 CI job."}
